						"description": "Creates a local event. Saves the event to Postgres, then indexes its coordinates into the `events:geo` Redis geo set via `GEOADD` (keyed by the event's UUID) so nearby-event queries can use `GEOSEARCH`/`GEORADIUS`. `user_id` is taken from the verified JWT (`sub` claim), not the request body. `expires_at` defaults to 24 hours after creation if not otherwise set server-side. `media_url` is optional - get one from **Get Presigned Upload URL** first, PUT the file to `presigned_url`, then pass the returned `media_url` here."
					},
